Package: nmabat
Title: Numerical Bias Adjustment Threshold Finding for NMA
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Miriam", "Van Bergeyk", , "mvanberg@uwaterloo.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package introduces general computational methods for one- or two-
    dimensional threshold analysis at any level of the data hierarchy (contrast,
    study or arm level) which accommodate arbitrary decision functions. This is 
    accomplished through iterative modification of the data and reassessment of the
    decision function until the boundary at which the decision changes is identified.
    An interval bisection search method is implemented for increased efficiency.
